[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2503341814","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99731#issuecomment-2503341814","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99731","id":2503341814,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VNfb2","user":{"login":"yosoyfreeman","id":64601424,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NjAxNDI0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64601424?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosoyfreeman","html_url":"https://github.com/yosoyfreeman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosoyfreeman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosoyfreeman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosoyfreeman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosoyfreeman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosoyfreeman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosoyfreeman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosoyfreeman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosoyfreeman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosoyfreeman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-27T09:19:49Z","updated_at":"2024-11-27T09:19:49Z","body":"Hi there! I been testing this as thoroughly as i can to make sure there are no compatibility issues. \r\n\r\nRight now, the fix works quite well, and produces a very natural result. However, it  can cause (correctly) the body to get some upwards direction as a consequence of sliding with the floor. Not a bug, but doesn't follow the design philosophy of the whole `CharacterBody` (No vertical input, no vertical output)\r\n\r\nI'm working on testing a couple different ways to approach the same thing while respecting that rule, even if that results in somewhat of a less natural slide, as i understand that right now we have to focus ourselves on fixing errors in the current algorithm, not to change the behavior itself. \r\n\r\nI'll update this as soon as i can with the news and test results.  I may be over cautious but i really want this to feel like it was there from the beginning, to work in a similar fashion to our current approach (For better or worse) and that it can't cause any kind of regressions.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2503341814/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2508932584","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99731#issuecomment-2508932584","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99731","id":2508932584,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Vi0Xo","user":{"login":"yosoyfreeman","id":64601424,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NjAxNDI0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64601424?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosoyfreeman","html_url":"https://github.com/yosoyfreeman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosoyfreeman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosoyfreeman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosoyfreeman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosoyfreeman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosoyfreeman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosoyfreeman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosoyfreeman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosoyfreeman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosoyfreeman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-30T11:39:04Z","updated_at":"2024-11-30T11:39:04Z","body":"Updated the PR to prevent the floor sliding from adding vertical motion to the body. As i said, bit less natural, but more coherent with the whole thing.\r\n\r\nVideos:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/30011c98-dff4-421f-9b12-6f576c43ea62\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5685b696-8fb9-4654-b276-53cb2fadf511\r\n\r\nAs you can see the lack of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99731 causes some instability in the body. That pr fixes bodies with `stop_on_slopes` from attempting to re-snap to things is already close enough.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2508932584/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2532201358","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99731#issuecomment-2532201358","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99731","id":2532201358,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6W7lOO","user":{"login":"yosoyfreeman","id":64601424,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NjAxNDI0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64601424?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosoyfreeman","html_url":"https://github.com/yosoyfreeman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosoyfreeman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosoyfreeman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosoyfreeman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosoyfreeman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosoyfreeman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosoyfreeman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosoyfreeman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosoyfreeman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosoyfreeman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-10T16:21:45Z","updated_at":"2024-12-10T16:21:45Z","body":"The current implementation of move and slide never really \"collides\" with the floor to properly handle vertical velocity, instead, it forces a projection of the velocity onto the plane defined by the up vector after all other resolution is done, which means altering the resolution to slide along the plane is \"out\" of the main algorithm, so properly sliding causes issues. I will try in the near future with another approach.\r\n\r\nYou can close this for now if you think is the best thing, otherwise i would like to keep it open to keep track of the issues and progression on this matter.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2532201358/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2532888111","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99731#issuecomment-2532888111","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99731","id":2532888111,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6W-M4v","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/use